{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ProUser 是一款把日常句子直接化成行事曆行程的工具，用戶只需輸入「明天九時與 Sam 喝咖啡」這類描述，行程便會自動建立，毋須翻查選單或日期選擇器。語言解析全程在裝置上完成，離線亦可運作，不設帳戶，亦不收集任何資料。它特別適合行程密集、思考速度快於點按速度的人。現時由原價 US $0.99 改為限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-23.webp\">\n<h2>離線語句指令建立行程</h2>\n<p>指令欄支援直接輸入或語音輸入，用戶寫下「週五上午七時健身」即可建立行程，亦可要求系統在指定時段內找出首個空檔，安排兩小時的深度工作。以自然語言修改時間、縮短或改名同樣可行，清空某個下午只需一句指令，所有變更均可即時復原。另設待辦清單與鎖定畫面快速新增，常用項目只需定義一次。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-264-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-265-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-266-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-267-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-268-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-269-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ProUser: Command Your Day</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T11:21:22.320483+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:04:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:37:52.017766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:17:47.382871+00:00","content_hash":"d812c2963b4ffd81299172bb7f12f9ed951c01b38f66d340e80463a3e2a29f99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}